announcement: this is a notice."}, {"lit": "notice", "meaning": "notice, announcement", "ctx": "The thing being introduced."}, {"lit": "from", "meaning": "from", "ctx": "Shows the source of the notice."}, {"lit": "RTÉ", "meaning": "RTÉ", "ctx": "Names the broadcaster."}, {"lit": "radio", "meaning": "radio", "ctx": "Part of the station name."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the (genitive feminine singular)", "ctx": "Part of Raidió na Gaeltachta, Radio of the Gaeltacht."}, {"lit": "Gaeltacht", "meaning": "Gaeltacht: Irish-speaking area (genitive: Gaeltachta)", "ctx": "Completes the station name."}, {"lit": "will be put", "meaning": "cuir: to put (future autonomous: cuirfear)", "ctx": "Starts the phrase cuirfear tús le, will be begun."}, {"lit": "beginning", "meaning": "tús: beginning, start", "ctx": "Part of cuirfear tús le, a start will be put to."}, {"lit": "with", "meaning": "le: with, to", "ctx": "Links tús to what is being started."}, {"lit": "series", "meaning": "sraith: series", "ctx": "The new series being started."}, {"lit": "new", "meaning": "nua: new", "ctx": "Describes the series."}, {"lit": "of programmes", "meaning": "clár: programme (genitive plural: clár)", "ctx": "Says the series is of programmes."}, {"lit": "on", "meaning": "ar: on", "ctx": "Gives where it will be broadcast."}, {"lit": "RTÉ", "meaning": "RTÉ", "ctx": "Names the broadcaster again."}, {"lit": "radio", "meaning": "radio", "ctx": "Part of the station name."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the (genitive feminine singular)", "ctx": "Part of Raidió na Gaeltachta."}, {"lit": "Gaeltacht", "meaning": "Gaeltacht: Irish-speaking area (genitive: Gaeltachta)", "ctx": "Completes the station name."}, {"lit": "day", "meaning": "Dé: day (in weekday names)", "ctx": "Part of Dé Luain, Monday."}, {"lit": "Monday", "meaning": "Luan: Monday (genitive: Luain)", "ctx": "Names the day."}, {"lit": "this", "meaning": "seo: this", "ctx": "Part of seo chugainn, coming up."}, {"lit": "to us", "meaning": "chugainn: to us, towards us", "ctx": "Part of seo chugainn, next."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the", "ctx": "Begins the title of the series."}, {"lit": "first", "meaning": "céad: first (lenited: chéad)", "ctx": "Describes glúin in the title."}, {"lit": "generation", "meaning": "glúin: generation (lenited: ghlúin)", "ctx": "Part of the title An Chéad Ghlúin Eile."}, {"lit": "other", "meaning": "eile: other, next", "ctx": "Means next in the title."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the", "ctx": "Introduces t-ainm, the name."}, {"lit": "name", "meaning": "ainm: name (with t-prefix: t-ainm)", "ctx": "Says this is the name."}, {"lit": "that", "meaning": "a: relative particle", "ctx": "Links the name to what it will be called."}, {"lit": "will be", "meaning": "bí: to be (future relative: bheidh)", "ctx": "States what the name will be."}, {"lit": "on", "meaning": "ar: on", "ctx": "In Irish, a name is on something."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the", "ctx": "Marks the following noun as definite."}, {"lit": "series", "meaning": "sraith: series (with t-prefix: tsraith)", "ctx": "The thing the name will be on."}, {"lit": "new", "meaning": "nua: new", "ctx": "Describes the series."}, {"lit": "this", "meaning": "seo: this", "ctx": "Points to this new series."}, {"lit": "will be", "meaning": "bí: to be (future: beidh)", "ctx": "Starts a sentence about broadcast time."}, {"lit": "the", "meaning": "an: the", "ctx": "Marks the series as definite."}, {"lit": "series", "meaning": "sraith: series (with t-prefix: tsraith)", "ctx": "The series is the subject."}, {"lit": "on", "meaning": "ar: on", "ctx": "Part of ar siúl, going on."}, {"lit": "movement", "meaning": "siúl: walking, movement", "ctx": "Part of ar siúl, on, taking place."}, {"lit": "at", "meaning": "ar: at, on", "ctx": "Introduces the time."}, {"lit": "half-hour", "meaning": "leathuair: half an hour", "ctx": "Gives half past in the time phrase."}, {"lit": "after", "meaning": "tar: after, over", "ctx": "Part of tar éis, after